{"meta":{"id":"tt0027977","type":"movie","name":"Tiempos Modernos","imdb_id":"tt0027977","description":"Extenuado por el frenético ritmo de la cadena de montaje, un obrero metalúrgico acaba perdiendo la razón. Después de recuperarse en un hospital, sale y es encarcelado por participar en una manifestación en la que se encontraba por casualidad. En la cárcel, también sin pretenderlo, ayuda a controlar un motín, gracias a lo cual queda en libertad. Una vez fuera, reemprende la lucha por la supervivencia en compañía de una joven huérfana a la que conoce en la calle.","poster":"https://btttr.cc/poster-q/imdb/poster-default/tt0027977.jpg?tag=none&lang=es-MX&rs=IM","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/kSlO1pHpwQfPQdgVPr7dJiJNtJ8.jpg","logo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/zdTrplb78OIGtIdD7Ud9DBtfpXh.png","genres":["Comedia","Drama","Romance"],"releaseInfo":"1936","released":"1936-02-05T12:00:00.000Z","status":"Released","runtime":"87 min","imdbRating":"8.5","country":"United States of America","cast":["Charlie Chaplin","Paulette Goddard","Henry Bergman","Tiny Sandford","Chester Conklin","Hank Mann","Stanley Blystone","Al Ernest Garcia","Richard Alexander","Cecil Reynolds","Mira McKinney","Murdock MacQuarrie","Wilfred Lucas","Edward LeSaint","Fred Malatesta","Sammy Stein","Juana Sutton","Ted Oliver","Norman Ainsley","Walter Bacon","Bobby Barber","Heinie Conklin","Gloria DeHaven","Gloria Delson","Pat Flaherty","Frank Hagney","Chuck Hamilton","Pat Harmon","Lloyd Ingraham","Walter James"],"director":["Charlie Chaplin"],"writer":["Charlie Chaplin"],"trailers":[{"source":"NNznUyDmSFc","type":"Trailer","name":"Modern Times (1936) ORIGINAL TRAILER [HD 1080p]","ytId":"NNznUyDmSFc","lang":"en"}],"trailerStreams":[{"ytId":"NNznUyDmSFc","title":"Modern Times (1936) ORIGINAL TRAILER [HD 1080p]"}],"links":[{"name":"8.5","category":"imdb","url":"https://imdb.com/title/tt0027977"},{"name":"Comedia","category":"Genres","url":"stremio:///discover/https%3A%2F%2Fv3-cinemeta